# Implementation Plan: Notifications Module

This document outlines the architectural strategy for the Notifications Module, delivering real-time, role-based event alerts to Farmers and Buyers across the AgriChain platform.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Real-Time Mechanism**: While the prompt suggests WebSockets or SSE, browser-based sandbox environments frequently drop long-lived streaming connections (like SSE/WS) when the preview pane sleeps or reconnects. To guarantee stability and a flawless user experience, I propose using **Optimized Short-Polling** via React Query (fetching every few seconds). This achieves the exact same "real-time" feel without the connection flakiness of SSE. Let me know if you approve of this stable approach!

